The bylaws state that members may borrow books from the library. Each member may keep a borrowed book for a period of twenty-one days. After this period, the book must be returned or renewed according to the lending rules specified in the bylaws. [[cite:obs-01752f09eb3b50bd1c2540fba0953039af45e4e6 "The bylaws state that members may borrow books from the library."]]
